NUMBER 2 OF 2020

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

THE MAYOR OF SOLOK,

Considering : a. that every person including women and children has the right to receive protection from violence, exploitation, and discriminatory treatment in order to provide security and comfort;

